# Section 6: window 2560 (poc8m_w2560; add it with geo_zusatz.py). Warm start
# from the section 5 end (sha256 f83fc26de816f4e4...,
# /root/ckpt/w2048v8_ep600.tch + .opt). Package B.
# 200 bf16 epochs planned with a fresh schedule, of which 30 are used; 2 cards
# (KARTEN=2,3, accumulation 4). The epoch-30 checkpoint ends this
# section: sha256 c6113dcf6c3ed4c4..., kept as
# /root/ckpt/w2560_stand.tch (+ .opt).
# The values are those of the environment file the run used.

